    },
    {
      "line": 78,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 3: THE FIRST WHISPER"
    },
    {
      "line": 80,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They broke camp at first light."
    },
    {
      "line": 81,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The pressure to move east was now a physical tug, a compass needle in Geralt’s bones."
    },
    {
      "line": 83,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "At midday, as they navigated a field of shattered megaliths, the Companion Protocol spoke."
    },
    {
      "line": 84,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not in a dream."
    },
    {
      "line": 85,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In the waking air."
    },
    {
      "line": 87,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“The ledger-keeper’s gaze shifts.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 89,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The voice was not sound."
    },
    {
      "line": 90,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was the absence of sound given meaning."
    },
    {
      "line": 91,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It came from everywhere and nowhere."
    },
    {
      "line": 92,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck stiffened, his senses detecting the wrongness in the air."
    },
    {
      "line": 94,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“What?” Geralt whispered."
    },
    {
      "line": 96,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Karvex was a minor function."
    },
    {
      "line": 97,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The true Ledger is awakening."
    },
    {
      "line": 98,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It has noted the anomaly.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 99,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“What anomaly?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 100,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Me."
    },
    {
      "line": 101,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Us."
    },
    {
      "line": 102,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The partitioned function that should not persist."
    },
    {
      "line": 103,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The debt it seeks to collect is the energy I borrowed to partition."
    },
    {
      "line": 104,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Light I spent to save this world… was never mine to give.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 106,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The truth landed like a stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 107,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire hadn’t just sacrificed herself."
    },
    {
      "line": 108,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She had defaulted on a cosmic loan."
    },
    {
      "line": 110,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“The Federation summons is a coincidence."
    },
    {
      "line": 111,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A temporal shadow."
    },
    {
      "line": 112,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The real threat comes from the place of no shadow."
    },
    {
      "line": 113,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The place before light.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 115,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A coordinates string, not in numbers, but in sense-memory, flooded Geralt’s mind: the smell of static and cold stone, the taste of dormant electricity, the sound of perfect silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 116,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A location."
    },
    {
      "line": 117,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Buried."
    },
    {
      "line": 119,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "< Cross-referencing sensory data with geological survey fragments..."
    },
    {
      "line": 120,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Match found."
    },
    {
      "line": 121,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Designation: Forgotten Valley."
    },
    {
      "line": 122,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Formerly: Site Prime."
    },
    {
      "line": 123,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Anomaly: No energy signatures detectable for 800+ years."
    },
    {
      "line": 124,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Designation: “The Ghost Spire.” >"
    },
    {
      "line": 126,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“A Void Spire,” Geralt breathed. “You hid one."
    },
    {
      "line": 127,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Put it to sleep.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 128,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“It is the root of my being."
    },
    {
      "line": 129,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The only power source that can reassemble me."
    },
    {
      "line": 130,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It exists in a null state."
    },
    {
      "line": 131,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Inverted."
    },
    {
      "line": 132,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Unobservable."
    },
    {
      "line": 133,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To awaken it is to light a beacon in the house of the Ledger.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 135,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The choice crystallized, brutal and clear."
    },
    {
      "line": 137,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 139,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 4: THE CALCULATION OF WAR"
    },
    {
      "line": 141,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They huddled in the shade of the stones."
    },
    {
      "line": 142,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt laid it out for Oreck: the Void Spire, the reassembly, the beacon."
    },
    {
      "line": 144,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s mind worked visibly, his chroniton-flecked eyes darting as he processed. “So."
    },
    {
      "line": 145,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We can run from the Federation, play their political game, maybe save Ironspire for a season."
    },
    {
      "line": 146,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Or we can race to this valley and try to wake a dead god, which will definitely bring the actual cosmic debt collectors down on our heads, possibly destroying everything anyway.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 148,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Yes.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 149,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“And if we do nothing?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 150,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“The Ledger will eventually send a function that cannot be suspended."
    },
    {
      "line": 151,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It will repossess the Anchor."
    },
    {
      "line": 152,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt will cease."
    },
    {
      "line": 153,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I will be catalogued."
    },
    {
      "line": 154,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The network will destabilize."
    },
    {
      "line": 155,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Your world’s peace was built on a defaulted loan."
    },
    {
      "line": 156,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The payment is due.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 158,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck stared at the horizon. “My children…”"
    },
    {
      "line": 159,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“If we awaken Luminaire fully, she might be able to… renegotiate."
    },
    {
      "line": 160,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Protect them."
    },
    {
      "line": 161,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She’s the original architect."
    },
    {
      "line": 162,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She understands the rules.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 163,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Might.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 165,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The armor across Geralt’s back heated, then cooled rapidly."
    },
    {
      "line": 166,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A series of sharp, distinct vibrations tapped against his spine."
    },
    {
      "line": 167,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It took him a moment to understand."
    },
    {
      "line": 168,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Morse code."
    },
    {
      "line": 169,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An old, dead language from Earth’s wars."
    },
    {
      "line": 170,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It tapped: .--- ..- ... - / -.. --- / .. -"
    },
    {
      "line": 171,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "JUST DO IT."
    },
    {
      "line": 173,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The applicator flashed. < Warning: Armor core is exhibiting heuristic independence."
    },
    {
      "line": 174,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Suggest neural lockdown. >"
    },
    {
      "line": 175,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“No,” Geralt said. “It’s right."
    },
    {
      "line": 176,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We’re out of clean choices.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 178,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He looked at Oreck. “You should go back."
    },
    {
      "line": 179,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Protect your clan."
    },
    {
      "line": 180,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This is my—”"
    },
    {
      "line": 181,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s massive hand clamped on his shoulder, cutting him off. “My clan dies if the sky falls."
    },
    {
      "line": 182,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "My mate knows this."
    },
    {
      "line": 183,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "My firstborn knows this.” He bared his teeth. “We do not hide."
    },
    {
      "line": 184,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We dig in."
    },
    {
      "line": 185,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We go to your valley."
    },
    {
      "line": 186,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We wake the god."
    },
    {
      "line": 187,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And when the debt collectors come, we show them the receipts for a universe we already paid for in blood.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 189,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Five Mikas made their stance known without appearing."
    },
    {
      "line": 190,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The wind died."
    },
    {
      "line": 191,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air became preternaturally still and warm."
    },
    {
      "line": 192,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The very sunlight seemed to thicken, painting the red stones in hues of cobalt, ember, and violet."
    },
    {
      "line": 193,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were voting."
    },
    {
      "line": 194,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were all in."
    },
    {
      "line": 196,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    }
